# --- Video -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Two classes of file live in this repo and the split is the whole point.
#
# MASTERS: video-masters/. Camera originals, ~200 MB each, HLG HDR in BT.2020.
# Never committed — GitHub rejects anything over 100 MB outright. Nothing here
# backs them up, so keep a copy somewhere else too.
video-masters/
*.mov
#
# WEB ENCODES: tracked, and they ARE the site. Tone-mapped to Rec.709 and cut to
# 720p30 H.264 with faststart.
#   meet-the-processor/assets/video/<slug>.mp4   block-sheet explainers, by slug
#   assets/home/*.mp4                            home page loops
# The encode chain and the reasoning are in meet-the-processor/README.md under
# "The sheet videos".

# Throwaway screenshots written by meet-the-processor/verify/*.py. Both paths:
# some scripts shoot into the page directory, some into verify/ beside themselves.
meet-the-processor/*.png
meet-the-processor/verify/*.png
meet-the-processor/render/
